<title>UK: GrandMet, the dealmaker, seals its biggest.</title>
<headline>GrandMet, the dealmaker, seals its biggest.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grand Metropolitan, one of Britain's leading food and drinks groups, has capped a decade of more than 30 strategic acquisitions with Monday's 20 billion pound ($32.5 billion) merger with Guinness Plc.</p>
<p>Here is a breakdown of its main acquisitions to date (in</p>
<p>pounds unless stated), acquisition price in brackets:</p>
<p>1988</p>
<p>Kaysens (21.5 million)</p>
<p>Peter's Savoury Products (75 million)</p>
<p>1989</p>
<p>The Pillsbury Company for (3.7 bln)</p>
<p>UB Restaurants for (180 million)</p>
<p>Sileno (undisclosed)</p>
<p>Metaxa (undisclosed)</p>
<p>Mont La Salle Vineyards (undisclosed)</p>
<p>1990</p>
<p>Anglo Espanola de Distribucion SA (undisclosed)</p>
<p>Berlin Surgeles (undisclosed)</p>
<p>Jus-Rol (46.5 million)</p>
<p>1991</p>
<p>R&amp;H Emmett (33 million)</p>
<p>Aunt Nellie's (undisclosed)</p>
<p>Jurgen Langbein (undisclosed)</p>
<p>1992</p>
<p>Cinzano (undisclosed)</p>
<p>McGlynn's Bakeries (undisclosed)</p>
<p>Knack &amp; Back (undisclosed)</p>
<p>1993</p>
<p>Roush Products Co (Not disclosed)</p>
<p>Glen Ellen and M.G. Vallejo (undisclosed)</p>
<p>North British Distillery Co (52 million stg)</p>
<p>1994</p>
<p>Distribution rights for Stolichnaya vodka/</p>
<p>other vodka brands in U.S. and Mexico (undisclosed)</p>
<p>U.S. distribution rights for Campari Aperitivo (undisclosed).</p>
<p>Rudi Foods Inc (Undisclosed)</p>
<p>Martha White (113 million stg)</p>
<p>Tegner &amp; Sons AB (undisclosed)</p>
<p>1995</p>
<p>Pet Inc  (1.7 bln)</p>
<p>La Saltena (Argentina) (undisclosed)</p>
<p>Pasta House (Australia) ($75 million)</p>
<p>Distribution rights for Stolichnaya Vodka in Canada,</p>
<p>the UK and UK duty free (Undisclosed).</p>
<p>Joint venture with Remy Coinreau to develop the Picon</p>
<p>Amer brand (44 million)</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366 ($ = 0.615 British Pounds)</p>
</text>
